  "body": "When in a group chat notifications are set to \"mention only\" it only looks at the localpart.\r\n\r\n@localpart:homeserver\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\nWhen two (or probably more) people in a group chat have the same localpart but are on a different homeserver, and one of them gets @mentiond they both(all) receive a notification.\r\n",
